('The Affordable Builder',RE+'nexus_builder',[1],['Assembler:8 Steel Plates,4 Motors,2 Electronic Circuits and1 Chest. The tool itself has no Nexus alloy, lattice, essence, star or singularity cost.','Place it at the geometric centre of the portal bottom layer, with native MI item input to its left, output to its right and an energy input directly behind. The separate top-right Box toggle previews the21x19x11footprint.']),
('Bootstrap Machine Shells',RE+'nexus_machine_casing',[14],['All three production machines use the new native-MI-part structural recipes. Shells use titanium, steel, iridium, superconductors, electronics and other native components; they do not require the machine being built.','Use the EMI layer guide. Pressure Casting Plant and Electroplating Line are9x9x5; the donut Particle Collider is21x21x5. Use native highly advanced item/fluid hatches and sufficient superconductor power.']),
('Pressure Casting Plant',RE+'pressure_casting_plant',[16],['Assemble and form the first9x9x5machine. Its controller needs native Quantum Hulls/circuits, motors, pumps, robot arms, titanium gears and superconductor wire.','Casting consumes selected mould, alloy, nitrogen and Cryofluid. Return the physical mould from its output hatch to the mould input. Drain warm coolant before storage fills.']),
('MI Alloy Preparation',RE+'nexus_alloy_ingot',[17,12],['Mixer:16iridium dust +32 tungsten dust +16superconductor dust +2 Netherite Ingots ->8 Nexus Alloy Blend.','Kanthal EBF: 8 blend +1000 mBUU Matter ->8 hot ingots. Vacuum Freezer:8 hot ->8 cooled Nexus Alloy Ingots. Each operation is a real native MI recipe.']),
('Choose a Physical Mould',RE+'nexus_mould_panel',[17],['Make moulds in the native MI Assembler from titanium/steel plates, titanium gears and a shape-specific pattern ingredient. Separate moulds select panels, light/heavy panels, casing blanks, carriers, frames, ring blanks and Core housings.','A mould is consumed and physically returned by the caster. Recirculate it; it has no random wear.']),
('Cast, Then Finish',RE+'nexus_panel',[18,19],['The caster makes rough parts, not directly placeable portal blocks. Finish them in the native MI Compressor, then use native MI Assembler recipes for the actual placed blocks.','Each panel casting uses1000 mBnitrogen and1000 mBCryofluid and returns1000 mBwarm coolant. Vacuum-freeze warm coolant to recover75%; supply fresh Cryofluid for the loss.']),
