('Salt Feeds the Baths',RE+'nexus_plating_electrolyte_bucket',[22],['Steel/Electric drill sediment ->MI Mixer seawater ->Salt Geode Chamber salt water ->MI Centrifuge salt. Native MI electrolyzing/chemistry makes sodium hydroxide and chlorine.','Chemical Reactor: sodium hydroxide, chlorine and water make cleaning solution. Copper dust, sulfuric acid and water make plating electrolyte. Used solutions are distinct fluids and cannot be piped back as fresh solution.']),
('Unplated Substrates',RE+'nexus_unplated_substrate',[20],['Cast and finish alloy carriers. In an MI Assembler,8carriers +8Create Precision Mechanisms +16 Diamonds +16 Certus make8unplated substrates. Sludge processing supplies the gems.']),
