('Particle Collider',RE+'particle_collider',[25,11,21],['Select the Collider controller recipe with MI recipe locking in EMI, then build the21x21x5donut. The two target feeds, essence/container feed, plasma/coolant hatches, output and power hatch remain real native MI blocks.','It draws262144 EU/t for1200base recipe ticks per8contained exotic matter. Its moving beams and completion flash represent actual processing.']),
('Dense Tungsten Targets',RE+'nexus_tungsten_target',[2],['MI Compressor:4 tungsten plates ->1dense target. Feed this to one collider injector. It is a consumed beam target.']),
('Charged Iridium Targets',RE+'nexus_iridium_target',[4,5],['MI Polarizer:2iridium plates and1neodymium dust ->1charged target. Feed this different target to the opposite injector. Native saved hatches hold unmatched feeds until the full recipe is ready.']),
('Cultivation Catalysts',RE+'nexus_biological_catalyst',[1],['MI Mixer prepares crop nutrients from wheat, carrots, potatoes and water. Assemble charcoal/cotton reinforcement into carbon mesh.','Each Biological Catalyst needs8 Compost,8 Silk Cocoons,8 Paper,8 Rubber Sheets,1 Nutrient and1 Carbon Mesh. Bulk essence therefore needs continuous cultivation, trees, silkworm and rubber production.']),
('Astral Essence',RE+'astral_essence',[29,2],['Compact each of nine mob drops separately in the MI Compressor, then combine three groups of three in the Assembler. This avoids an impossible nine-input Chemical Reactor recipe.','Macerate Nether Stars. Chemical Reactor:16 star dust +8 Mob Concentrates +8 Biological Catalysts ->8 Astral Essence. Each essence costs two stars and eight each of rotten flesh, bones, string, leather, slimeballs, blaze rods, pearls, ghast tears and magma cream.']),
('Collide in Containment',RE+'stabilized_exotic_matter',[26,27,28,30],['Provide8 Astral Essence,8 of each target,8 empty containment cells,1000 mBHelium Plasma and4000 mBCryofluid. The collider produces8contained Stabilized Exotic Matter and4000 mBwarm coolant.','Full outputs, missing targets, missing coolant or power pause processing. Expensive inputs and progress are managed and saved by native MI machinery.']),
('Recover Containment Cells',RE+'nexus_exotic_matter',[31],['Use the native MI Centrifuge to open8contained exotic matter, yielding8recovered exotic matter and returning8 empty cells. Reuse the cells in the collider.','Route the recovered material to the Assembler and return empty cells to the Collider.']),
('Phase Lattices',RE+'phase_lattice',[32,24],['Native MI Assembler:8rinsed substrates +8recovered exotic matter ->8 Phase Lattices. No second charge for the alloy or Astral Essence already inside these components.','The full portal/Core bill contains 1536 lattices. Supply bulk production rather than trying to carry every project feedstock in one inventory.']),
('Six Ignition Cells',RE+'nexus_ignition_cell',[33,9,30],['Each cell requires16 Nexus Alloy,8 Phase Lattices,16 Astral Essence,4 Quantum Circuits and1native MI Singularity. Make six for one Core.']),
('Phase-stabilized Ring',RE+'nexus_ring',[33,30],['Finish a pressure-cast ring blank, then assemble it with24 Lattices,16 Astral Essence and2 Superconductor Wire. The portal requires48individual ring blocks.']),
