('The Nexus Core',RE+'nexus_core',[34,25],['Finish the cast Core housing. Assemble it with6 Ignition Cells,16 Contacts,16 Engineering Processors and8 Quantum Circuits.','This is the placed Core block, separate from the frame. The recipe connects nuclear singularities, fusion/plasma, UU Matter, quantum circuitry, all three new machines and large Revo production streams.']),
('Certify the Program',RE+'nexus_construction_program',[37,15],['Make the inexpensive blank program first. The final native MI Assembler recipe requires the completed Nexus Core as a retained input with zero consumption probability. The same Core can then be deposited into the builder for the portal.','A blank program cannot run the builder. The server checks the real recipe inputs; client-side quest checkmarks do not unlock construction.']),
('Supply the Placed Structure',RE+'nexus_casing',[20],['Make the portal casings, foundations, stairs/trim, grates, columns, panels, lamps and vents through their distinct MI Assembler recipes. Each recipe has distinguishable inputs.','The builder UI lists every needed item. Empty cells are grey/translucent ghost items; deposited cells use the normal icon. Each counter holds up to the blueprint quantity, even above64. Click with a matching carried stack to deposit, or empty cursor to withdraw up to64. Shift-click deposits from your inventory.']),
